          <p class="text-blue-600 text-[10px] mt-0.5">Link tercatat di sheet <strong>IDCard_MAPSI</strong>. Bisa diakses kapan saja.</p>\
        </div>\
      </div>\
    `;\
  \}\
\
  html += `\
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 pt-2">\
        <button onclick="downloadCardKTPPDF()" class="bg-brand-text hover:bg-slate-800 text-white font-bold py-3 px-3 rounded-xl text-xs transition-all shadow-md flex items-center justify-center space-x-2">\
          <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf"></i><span>Unduh PDF</span>\
